  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "\u0110\xEAm. S\u01B0\u01A1ng d\xE0y. \u0110u\u1ED1c b\u1ECDc l\xE1 t\u01B0\u01A1i
      t\u1ECFa kh\xF3i xanh. T\u1ED5 c\xF4ng binh c\u1EAFm c\u1ECDc ch\xECm \u1EDF
      b\u1EBFn s\xF4ng, b\u1EC7n th\u1EEBng gai k\xE9o qua l\xF2ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      nh\u01B0 l\u01B0\u1EDBi. Tr\xEAn \u0111\xE8o G\u1ED1c Mun, ch\xF4ng \u0111\u1EB7t
      z\xEDch-z\u1EAFc, \u0111\xE1 l\u0103n bu\u1ED9c ch\u1ED1t ch\u1EDD k\xE9o."
    - "Thuy\u1EC1n l\u01B0\u01A1ng Ki\u1EC1u m\u1EAFc c\u1ECDc ngay kh\xFAc qu\xE0nh.
      Hai bao mu\u1ED1i r\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc, b\u1ECDt tr\u1EAFng loang.
      G\xF9i mu\u1ED1i b\u1ECB ch\u1EB7n \u1EDF y\xEAn ng\u1EF1a v\xEC d\xE2y gai
      v\u01B0\u1EDBng. Ch\u1EE3 b\u1EA3n v\u1EAFng, b\u1EBFp trong th\xE0nh l\u1EEDa
      th\u01B0a. Trinh s\xE1t \u0111\u1EBFm s\u1ED1 n\u1ED3i kh\xF3i: \xEDt d\u1EA7n
      theo ng\xE0y."
